這段 CTE 卡住的主因是 NOT EXISTS 與 GROUP BY 導致大量關聯表進行全表掃描。
改用最精簡的直接查詢，只抓 死亡名單（Deceased = 1） 且屬於 Japanese Finance 的資料：
SELECT 
    A.EntityId,
    A.FullName AS SdnName,
    CONVERT(VARCHAR, A.UpdatedDate_UTC, 112) AS UpdatedDate
FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity A WITH (NOLOCK)
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_SanctionListReference B WITH (NOLOCK) 
    ON A.EntityId = B.EntityId
WHERE A.Deceased = 1
  AND B.SanctionListReference LIKE '%Japanese Finance%';

同步後確認是否寫入
執行完同步後，直接用 IN 比對目標表，秒查寫入狀態：
SELECT 
    ent_num,
    spec_name,
    remark AS EntityId,
    updated_date,
    DInd
FROM BSADBJP..OFAC_SPEC WITH (NOLOCK)
WHERE GROUPID = 5
  AND remark IN (
      SELECT CAST(A.EntityId AS VARCHAR(100))
      FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity A WITH (NOLOCK)
      JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_SanctionListReference B WITH (NOLOCK) 
          ON A.EntityId = B.EntityId
      WHERE A.Deceased = 1
        AND B.SanctionListReference LIKE '%Japanese Finance%'
  );

